{"unit_id":"xiciyang__inference-quantization#card-zh","repo":"xiciyang/inference-quantization","commit":"cde5a08588a42d469643142af441f9ca9821fdc8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"inference-quantization 是面向 DSH 的模型量化插件，提供工具接口并可在需要时注册状态 HTTP 路由。它接收模型 checkpoint，执行 PTQ 量化，并通过校准与测试数据集的内容哈希检查、精度门禁和真实 serving 端点性能评测验证结果。主要能力包括 AWQ/INT4 等量化方法、失败时按策略尝试其他精度、生成 QAT 计划、读取量化报告、列出矩阵记录和回退运行。适合需要在 DSH 工作流中量化模型并比较精度和吞吐的用户。运行完整流程需 Node.js、GPU、Docker、量化镜像，并提供精度容忍值和性能目标。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:18-45","src/tools.mjs:1-45","src/quantize.mjs:1-20","src/gate.mjs:1-25"]}
{"unit_id":"xiciyang__inference-quantization#card-en","repo":"xiciyang/inference-quantization","commit":"cde5a08588a42d469643142af441f9ca9821fdc8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"inference-quantization provides DSH tools for PTQ model quantization. It checks data separation, measures accuracy and throughput against supplied targets, and supports fallback methods, QAT plans, reports, and rollback. Runs need a GPU and Docker.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:18-45","src/tools.mjs:1-45","src/quantize.mjs:1-20","src/gate.mjs:1-25"]}
